T1  - Randomised controlled trial and economic evaluation of podophyllotoxin solution, podophyllotoxin cream, and podophyllin in the treatment of genital warts.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/sti.79.4.270
A1  - Lacey, C J N
A1  - Goodall, R L
A1  - Tennvall, G Ragnarson
A1  - Maw, R
