T1  - Nutritional variation and cardiovascular risk factors in Tanzania--rural-urban difference.
A1  - Njelekela, Marina
A1  - Sato, Toshiaki
A1  - Nara, Yasuo
A1  - Miki, Tomohiro
A1  - Kuga, Sachiko
A1  - Noguchi, Takanori
